> If I understand correctly that snippet on the GH actions if we upload a single wheel with a newer version, all wheels that have an older than 5 versions will be removed.

@participant3 Yes. Within 24 hours of an upload the CI will trim it down to 5 versions max (so you can have more than up there for a brief period).

I see that PR https://github.com/apache/arrow/pull/45442 has been merged now (👍). Let us know if in the next automated upload the Windows wheels aren't restored.
